            <L-4 L="FOR-ALL">CANFD364</L-4>
          </LONG-NAME>
          <DESC>
            <L-2 L="FOR-ALL">AUTOSAR series communication matrix (application + CanNm ASR 0x600-0x6FF + UDS diag 0x74C/0x75C/0x7DF). Calibration/XCP is NOT part of this matrix; see CANFD364_XCP_Dev.dbc and configure Xcp PDU in DaVinci/EcuC only.</L-2>
          </DESC>
          <ADMIN-DATA>
            <SDGS>
              <SDG GID="DV:ToolData">
                <SD GID="DV:ToolName">Vector Legacy Database Converter</SD>
                <SD GID="DV:ToolVersion">1.8.67.0</SD>
